<section class="panel cp-span-full">
    <h2>Essential addons</h2>
    <p>Copy-paste GitHub links into the launcher. Manual install: extract to <code>\twmoa_1181\Interface\AddOns</code>, rename folder to exact addon name (no -master suffix).</p>
