        <li><a href="https://gitlab.com/Taroven/pfQuest-turtle" target="_blank" rel="noopener">pfQuest-Turtle</a> — quest tracker (needs <a href="https://github.com/The-Kludge-Bureau/pfQuest" target="_blank" rel="noopener">pfQuest</a>)</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/NiclasEriksen/Bagshui" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Bagshui</a> — bag management</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/Otari98/aux-addon" target="_blank" rel="noopener">aux-addon</a> — better auction house</li>
        <li><a href="https://github.com/sica42/TurtleMail" target="_blank" rel="noopener">TurtleMail</a> — better mail inbox</li>
