<section class="panel cp-span-half">
    <h2>FAQ</h2>
    <p><strong>How is this different from other Turtle clones?</strong> OctoWoW serves NA/EU off the 1.17.2 leak plus backported 1.18.1 content. CapyWoW serves Chinese + multilingual audiences. Most of this guide works there too.</p>
    <p><strong>War Mode?</strong> NPC in Orgrimmar/Stormwind War Quarter enables PvP, +5% XP globally.</p>
    <p><strong>Rested XP?</strong> Inns fill in ~15 min, +70% kill XP. pfUI visualizes it.</p>
    <p><strong>How to PvP?</strong> Queue any level near minimap icon. XP flows, great past 30. PvP minis: <a href="https://rentry.org/ravencraft-pvp" target="_blank" rel="noopener">rentry PvP guide</a>.</p>
    <p><strong>How to dungeons?</strong> Level 13+, walk there yourself. Finder slow as DPS — /who your bracket (e.g. /who 20-28 for SFK), recruit healer first, rest follows.</p>
</section>

